      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yep, setting up a consistent group banner is borderline impossible.\n\nIt's different based on name length, VRC+ subscription and maybe even more things. If the displayed part of the banner would just get wider, but the height of the used image is the same, that would likely already help. Just some way to have a predictable behavior and a web interface to reflect that without the need of trial and error upload-spamming to the image library.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
