  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The banner image for groups is next to impossible to design for when incorporating text because a players VRC+ icon, or name length, or status message moves the banner all over the place! There needs to be a system where we can either upload two images. One for the tag above the head and one for the larger banner visible on website, or we need a mapped texture with documentation so we can put multiple sizes of the same tag on one image and it will display the corresponding section of the image based on scale and location.",
